 "text": "Home\n/\nEvents Listing\nEvents Listing\n84 Result(s) Found\nJack-O-Jaunt\n30\nOct\n2026\n If you dare, come join ghosts and goblins and stroll through our jack-o-lantern display at Lytton Plaza!\nTagged as: \n, \nActivities & Classes \n, \nCommunity Events\nHousehold Hazardous Waste Station Open\n31\nOct\n2026\n Dispose unwanted hazardous household products such as used or expired medication, paints, solvents, fuels, cleaners, pesticides and more.\nHousehold Hazardous Waste Station, 2501 Embarcadero Way,  \n29 more dates\nTagged as: \n, \nCommunity Events\nThursday Live on Cal Ave.\n31\nOct\n2026\n Thursday Live on Cal Ave. will transform car free Cal Ave. into a lively gathering space with popular, local music talent, interactive activities, free giveaways, games and themed programming for all ages.\nCar Free Portion of Cal Ave., Cal Ave. between El Camino Real and Birch Street, Palo Alto, CA \nTagged as: \n, \nCommunity Events\nHoliday Toy Drive\n01\nNov\n2026\n All donations will go to local youth in need this holiday season! Please donate new and unwrapped toys, books, gift cards, and other gifts no later than December 16.\nLucie Stern Community Center, 1305 Middlefield Road, Palo Alto, CA 94301\nTagged as: \n, \nActivities & Classes \n, \nCommunity Events\nMagical Tennis\n01\nNov\n2026\n Magical multi-session tennis class thoughtfully designed for neurodiverse players! All abilities welcome.\nMitchell Park Tennis Courts, 3800 Middlefield Rd, Palo Alto, CA 94306\n1 more date\nTagged as: \n, \nCity Sponsored Events\n, \nCommunity Events\nCity Council Meeting\n02\nNov\n2026\n Tune into this City Council meeting. Council will review several items listed on this meeting's agenda.\n4 more dates\nTagged as: \n, \nCity Council Meetings\nAmazing Animals\n04\nNov\n2026\n Join us and discover the wonders of zoology at the Palo Alto Junior Museum & Zoo. Each week, we will explore a fun science activity and meet a new amazing animal!\n4 more dates\nTagged as: \n, \nEducation Events\nAfter School Amazing Animals\n04\nNov\n2026\n Join us and discover the wonders of zoology at the Palo Alto Junior Museum & Zoo. Each week, we will explore a fun science activity and meet a new amazing animal!\n4 more dates\nTagged as: \n, \nEducation Events\nScience with a Twist\n04\nNov\n2026\n Dive into science with a twist at the Palo Alto Junior Museum & Zoo. Learn about a variety of science topics exploring physics, biology, chemistry, and earth science.\n4 more dates\nTagged as: \n, \nEducation Events\nCanceled\nFinance Committee Meeting\n04\nNov\n2026\n Attend the Finance Committee Meeting as the committee discusses topics related to the budget and fiscal planning\nTagged as: \n, \nCity Council Meetings\n Page \n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n9\nPrevious\n1\n2\n3\n…\n9\nNext\n Page 1 of 9\nSearch Events\n Search by phrase or keyword\n By Date\n MM/DD/YYYY\n RadDatePicker\nRadDatePicker\nOpen the calendar popup.\nCalendar\nTitle and navigation\nTitle and navigation\n<<\n<\nOctober 2026\n>\n<<\nOctober 2026\nS\nM\nT\nW\nT\nF\nS\n40\n27\n28\n29\n30\n1\n2\n3\n41\n4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n9\n10\n42\n11\n12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n43\n18\n19\n20\n21\n22\n23\n24\n44\n25\n26\n27\n28\n29\n30\n31\n45\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n7\n To\n MM/DD/YYYY\n RadDatePicker\nRadDatePicker\nOpen the calendar popup.\nCalendar\nTitle and navigation\nTitle and navigation\n<<\n<\nOctober 2026\n>\n<<\nOctober 2026\nS\nM\nT\nW\nT\nF\nS\n40\n27\n28\n29\n30\n1\n2\n3\n41\n4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n9\n10\n42\n11\n12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n43\n18\n19\n20\n21\n22\n23\n24\n44\n25\n26\n27\n28\n29\n30\n31\n45\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n7\n By Neighborhood\nPalo Alto, CA\nStanford, CA\nSunnyvale, CA\nEast Palo Alto, CA\nMenlo Park, CA\nSan Jose, CA\nMountain View, CA\nType to filter available options. Press up and down arrow keys to move between options. Press Enter key to select or unselect an option. Multiple options may be selected. Selected options are placed above the input field.\nCurrently selected options\n By Catego